CloudBurrow patch 8 to github.com/goccy/bigquery-emulator v0.8.1
(cloudburrow/cloudburrow#1103, #1057); needs patch 0002 and googlesqlite
patch 0018.

The bug: jobs.get (Project.Job, findJobsMetadata), jobs.getQueryResults
(Repository.FindJob) and Job.Wait, which calls FindJob every 100 ms until
the job is done, read a job with a GoogleSQL WHERE on the jobs table's
primary key, and googlesqlite compiles each WHERE comparison to a
function call that SQLite cannot answer from the key, so each read
visited every job the emulator kept. Patch 0007 did this for AddJob's
check that an ID is free.

The patch reads one job by its key as SQLite SQL (googlesqlite's
Conn.QueryRawContext, with the key encoded as googlesqlite stores a
STRING), where SQLite uses the primary key's index, and decodes the
row's columns as googlesqlite would. jobs.list, which reads every job
of a project, is unchanged.

